## Decision Matrix

| Cache Type | Use This Key | Reasoning |
|------------|--------------|-----------|
| Zilliz RAG | `company_id` | Documents are company-scoped |
| Tavily Web Search | `user_id` | External data, safest to isolate |
| Exa Search | `user_id` | External data, safest to isolate |
| API Clients (Voyage, Milvus) | Shared (no key) | No user data, just connections |

## Trade-offs

| Storage | Setup | Scalability | Hit Rate | Best For |
|---------|-------|-------------|----------|----------|
| In-process TTLCache | Simple | Single worker | Per-worker | Development |
| Redis/Memcached | Moderate | Multi-worker | Shared | Production |

